      "status": "bounded-art-pass",
      "finding": "First and second feet were each crossed through their precise native 20px L paths by actual input. Coarse grey pressed granular facets, iron-red cleaved edges and blue bare beds distinguish material roles. Separated bodies require an exposed transfer before the differently oriented second inner turn; unlike continuous cork banks or connected sentinel high/low shoulders.",
